      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "Not saving avatars from pedestals is by design for the time being. For now it will keep the last one you have selected even if you open and close the app.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-02-17T04:24:23.663Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently, if you want to use an avatar selectable in a Avatar World in game, it overwrites any previously selected avatar. Users who have taken the long effort of uploading their own characters may not have any issues switching at will, but other users find themselves having to leave a party, gathering or conversation completely to go get a different avatar. \nMy suggestion here is simple. Add a list below PUBLIC and PERSONAL lists of avatars that is called RECENT\nThis list will save any avatar the player changes into, for later use. (This list would not inclide default or personal avatars, only ones selected in game.)\nThe list will be 5 avatars long. Any new avatar added will erase the oldest one in the list.",
